;AUTHOR STATES THAT THE REFERENCE SEQUENCE FROM THE DATABASE          
 REPRESENTS A TRUNCATED VERSION OF THE FULL LENGTH HIV ENV SEQUENCE.  
 NUMBERING OF THE GP120 IS BASED ON THE HXBC2 ENV. CHAINS G AND A     
 BOTH HAVE A HISTIDINE TO SERINE MUTATION AT POSITION 375 IN THE      
 STRUCTURE. RESIDUES 31-43 AND 493-511 ARE THE FULL LENGTH N AND C-TERMINI OF THE SEQUENCE REFERENCED IN THE DATABASE.  CYS 31 is also an engineered mutation (originally SER in sequence)
;
